      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "There's already a prefab out there that's pretty good at adjusting a player properly to sitting in a chair. and while it doesn't work for everyone I've had them in my world now and they seem to work for basically 99% of humanoid avatars. The only problem being this will override any emotes or gesture that the person has set which can be kind of annoying. So having this built into the base game would be preferable. Of course that's not an absolute fix but it's way better than the chairs currently are",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
