  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Locking the hip bone to a set position rather than only relying on the animations would make chairs a lot more reliable. Currently the way the animation plays out causes all avatars to either sink into a chair or float above it. An adjustment of the animation to prevent it from moving the hip at all or making the hip lock into a specified location would likely fix this issue.",
